          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. 50.5 mph"
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. 52.5 mph"
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. 54 mph"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: C \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "By the time Dave leaves, Alice has already been traveling for half an hour. Three hours later, she would've been traveling for 3"
