            "value": "\u05d2\u201e"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "hours at 45 mph, or 157.5 miles."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "In order to travel 157.5 miles in 3 hours, Dave would have to travel at 52.5 mph (divide 157.5 by 3)."
          }
