    "Question #: 18": {
      "Title": "Exam ASVAB Test topic 1 question 1084 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "In privatization, the government relies on the private sector to provide a service. However, the government divests itself of the entire process, including all assets."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "With privatized functions, the government may specify quality, quantity, and timeliness requirements, but it has no control over the operations of the activity. Also, the government may not be the only customer. Whoever the government chooses to provide the services would likely provide the same services to others."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "This paragraph best supports the statement that __________."
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. the government must closely supervise privatized functions"
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. privatized functions consist of a mixture of government employees, military personnel, and private contractors"
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. privatized functions are those institutions that provide services only to a government agency"
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. privatized functions provide essential services to the government"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: D \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Privatized functions operate independently of the government, making Choices \"the government must closely supervise privatized functions\" and \"privatized functions consist of a mixture of government employees, military personnel, and private contractors\" incorrect."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The passage states that privatized functions may sell goods and services to other customers as well as the government, so Choice \"privatized functions are those institutions that provide services only to a government agency\" is also incorrect."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Choice \"privatized functions provide essential services to the government\" is the correct answer, as privatized functions do perform essential services to government agencies."
          }
        ]
      },
      "Explanation": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Privatized functions operate independently of the government, making Choices \"the government must closely supervise privatized functions\" and \"privatized functions consist of a mixture of government employees, military personnel, and private contractors\" incorrect."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The passage states that privatized functions may sell goods and services to other customers as well as the government, so Choice \"privatized functions are those institutions that provide services only to a government agency\" is also incorrect."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Choice \"privatized functions provide essential services to the government\" is the correct answer, as privatized functions do perform essential services to government agencies."
          }
        ]
      },
